Z||000000||loafer87gt||04-18-2000||07:32 PM||||Hey guys,<P>As I mentioned in my previous posts I have been looking for another little sports car to replace my beloved little Fiero. I just got back from taking a 94 Del Sol SI out for a rip and I gotta admit, I was smiling ear to ear. The red line on the little beastie was 8500 RPM and the Vtech model that I drove has 160 Horsepower, not too bad for 1.6 litre engine! The only thing that really bugs me about the car is that it doesn't look anywhere near as good as my old Fiero GT, but the interior is really sweet and the seats fit me just right. I'm really tempted, but I want to look around a bit more. By the way, three weeks later, the GM boys still haven't been able to figure out whats wrong with my GT, and still won't lend me a loner car  <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/forum/frown.gif">    A least when I do get it back it should be like a new car being as they have replaced everything from the seats back trying to figure the problem out!<P>||||reg||1
